WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:03.840
Someone.

00:04.960 --> 00:07.440
Bring me a jar of wine.

00:14.960 --> 00:16.627
They say candlelight is spiritual.

00:17.560 --> 00:18.960
Now.

00:19.840 --> 00:21.200
I cannot return.

00:21.960 --> 00:24.627
Can only hope you'll move a few steps.

00:27.320 --> 00:28.720
The war is over.

00:30.880 --> 00:32.280
What I should do.

00:33.440 --> 00:34.840
Is all done.

00:37.920 --> 00:40.920
I've accumulated quite a few complaints to tell you.

00:47.800 --> 00:49.200
Ruolan.

00:51.960 --> 00:53.360
I'll see you soon.

01:15.720 --> 01:19.640
Your Highness why are you staring at me?

01:24.880 --> 01:28.360
Playing the hero, playing the hero, drinking even when injured.

01:33.560 --> 01:38.840
Let me see how badly you're hurt it hurts it really hurts.

01:54.640 --> 01:56.040
Your Highness.

01:56.960 --> 02:01.880
I'm sorry if only I had been by your side then.

